<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11728" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπειρία</span></b>  (A), ἡ,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπειρος</span> A) opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπειρία,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>want of skill, inexperience,
				ignorance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Lex</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.80
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπειρία τε τῆς ἀπειρίας κρατεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					619
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ μὲν ἐμπειρία τέχνην ἐποίησεν ἡ δ᾽
					ἀπειρία τύχην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polus
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				981a5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ ἀπειρίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					167b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι᾽ ἀπειρίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					518d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ θανεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					816.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μέθης</span>
			<i>want of skill</i> to carry it discreetly, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				4.3.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔργου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					3.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μουσικῆς ἀπειρίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philetaer.
					18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι᾽ ἀπειρίαν τοῦ ἐρωτᾶν καὶ
					ἀποκρίνεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					487b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπειρείῃσι νόοιο</span> (sic) <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				1078.5
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Adana</span>).</div>
